  {
   "title": "Coven: Brad Scott's Birthday Bash w/ Eric Vain",
   "fullUrl": "/event-calendar/coven-brad-scotts-birthday-bash-w-eric-vain",
   "startDate": 1795312800376,
   "endDate": 1795323540376,
   "assetUrl": "https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5ec2b1c4a98dab4be3179e42/1792541779379-G7AR72KMDVBU6LLF2WEK/11-21_BradBirthday_COVEN_IG_v2.jpeg",
   "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6ad8040c34f8517e25684ffa\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d771b680-49a1-4d28-a6bb-fd5cbf18dfc8_1058/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d771b680-49a1-4d28-a6bb-fd5cbf18dfc8_1058/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"a7b5cfa969b137da8730\" id=\"block-a7b5cfa969b137da8730\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">🩸 DADDY’S HAVING A BIRTHDAY. 🩸</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">On Saturday, November 21, we’re celebrating Coven Daddy Supreme BRAD SCOTT the way he likes it: dark, sweaty, and surrounded by his favorite creatures. 🖤</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Coven founding member ERIC VAIN returns to headline  joining the birthday boy himself, BRAD SCOTT &amp; THE UNHOLY BODIES.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Come serve a look, worship the dance floor, and help Daddy blow out his candles. Getting older is inevitable. Behaving is optional. 😈</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">📍 Lafayette Bar • 15 N. 4th St., Easton<br>🕘 9 PM–1:30 AM<br>🖤 $15 • 21+ • Non-smoking</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-a7b5cfa969b137da8730 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 2px;\n    \n      --tweak-text-block-stroke-color: hsla(var(--black-hsl), 1)\n;\n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-a7b5cfa969b137da8730 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-a7b5cfa969b137da8730 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-a7b5cfa969b137da8730 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  #block-a7b5cfa969b137da8730 {\n      --tweak-text-block-blend\n  : normal;\n    }\n  \n\n  #block-a7b5cfa969b137da8730 {\n    --blur-value: blur(15px);}\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-a7b5cfa969b137da8730 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-a7b5cfa969b137da8730 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-vars\">\n    #block-a7b5cfa969b137da8730 {\n      --opacity: 100%;\n      --translate-x: 0px;\n      --translate-y: 0px;\n      --rotation: 0deg;\n      --scale-x: 100%;\n      --scale-y: 100%;\n      --skew-x: 0deg;\n      --skew-y: 0deg;\n      --origin-x: 50%;\n      --origin-y: 50%;\n      --block-transform: none;\n\n      opacity: var(--opacity, 1);\n      transform: var(--block-transform);\n      transform-origin: var(--origin-x) var(--origin-y);\n    }\n  </style><style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
