   "assetUrl": "https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5ec2b1c4a98dab4be3179e42/1774485893538-9CBK5KPRSREKOJNWB8BE/IMG_2025.jpeg",
   "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-69c481149a56c8086d002e6a\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d771b680-49a1-4d28-a6bb-fd5cbf18dfc8_1058/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d771b680-49a1-4d28-a6bb-fd5cbf18dfc8_1058/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"e3f5d59cbe44f32f819e\" id=\"block-e3f5d59cbe44f32f819e\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h2 style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">December 13 – Holiday Tea</h2><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The holidays are here and <strong>High Tea at Playhouse Deck</strong> is the perfect festive Sunday escape.</p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Join us at Bucks County Playhouse for an afternoon of cocktails, music, and holiday cheer as <strong>DJ Brad Scott spins from 4–8 PM</strong>. Gather with friends, enjoy the beautiful winter views of New Hope, and celebrate the season with the community that makes High Tea so special.</p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">A perfect way to toast the end of the year together.</p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">All proceeds support the non-profit mission of Bucks County Playhouse.</p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Bucks County Playhouse</strong><br><strong>70 S Main Street</strong><br><strong>New Hope, PA 18938</strong></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-e3f5d59cbe44f32f819e {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-e3f5d59cbe44f32f819e .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-e3f5d59cbe44f32f819e {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-e3f5d59cbe44f32f819e {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-e3f5d59cbe44f32f819e .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
