   "endDate": 1793844000071,
   "assetUrl": "https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5ec2b1c4a98dab4be3179e42/1793657606004-GOLF6VDIUETJ8OFQNQUN/IMG_4012.png",
   "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6ae90abc0e9f2756fcf83c05\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d771b680-49a1-4d28-a6bb-fd5cbf18dfc8_1058/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d771b680-49a1-4d28-a6bb-fd5cbf18dfc8_1058/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"c50411852838e6958464\" id=\"block-c50411852838e6958464\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>2026 | Bing-Ho Drag Bingo</strong></h2><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">3/4, 5/13, 7/8, 9/2, &amp; 11/4</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">🎉 Bing-HO Drag Bingo at Lost Tavern Brewing! 🎉</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Get ready for a night of fun, fierce performances, and fabulous prizes at Bing-HO Drag Bingo—the ultimate drag bingo experience! Hosted by the one and only Heidi Ho and Estee Lauderdale, this event is guaranteed to be an unforgettable evening of entertainment, laughter, and, of course, BINGO!</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">📅 Event Dates:</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">&nbsp; &nbsp; • &nbsp; &nbsp;March 3rd, 2026</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">&nbsp; &nbsp; • &nbsp; &nbsp;May 13th, 2026</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">&nbsp; &nbsp; • &nbsp; &nbsp;July 8th, 2026</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">&nbsp; &nbsp; • &nbsp; &nbsp;September 2nd, 2026</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">&nbsp; &nbsp; • &nbsp; &nbsp;November 4th, 2026</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Check-in 6:00 PM</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">🕖 Time: 7:00 PM - 9:00 PM</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">📍 Location: Lost Tavern Brewing, Hellertown, PA</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">🎟 Tickets: $15 per bingo board (good for all 10 games) | Additional boards available</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">✨ What to Expect:</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">💃 Stunning drag performances</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">🎤 Hosted by the fabulous Heidi Ho</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">🎁 Exciting prizes &amp; giveaways</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">🍻 Delicious drinks from Lost Tavern Brewing</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">🚚 A food truck on-site to keep you fueled</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">💖 All proceeds from Bing-HO Drag Bingo support The Swingle Family Foundation and its mission to uplift and support the LGBTQ+ community.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Gather your friends, grab your bingo boards, and get ready to shout BING-HO! You won’t want to miss this dazzling night of drag, drinks, and fun—all for a great cause!</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">🔥 Tickets are limited—secure yours now!</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-c50411852838e6958464 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 2px;\n    \n      --tweak-text-block-stroke-color: hsla(var(--black-hsl), 1)\n;\n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-c50411852838e6958464 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-c50411852838e6958464 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-c50411852838e6958464 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  #block-c50411852838e6958464 {\n      --tweak-text-block-blend\n  : normal;\n    }\n  \n\n  #block-c50411852838e6958464 {\n    --blur-value: blur(15px);}\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-c50411852838e6958464 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-c50411852838e6958464 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-vars\">\n    #block-c50411852838e6958464 {\n      --opacity: 100%;\n      --translate-x: 0px;\n      --translate-y: 0px;\n      --rotation: 0deg;\n      --scale-x: 100%;\n      --scale-y: 100%;\n      --skew-x: 0deg;\n      --skew-y: 0deg;\n      --origin-x: 50%;\n      --origin-y: 50%;\n      --block-transform: none;\n\n      opacity: var(--opacity, 1);\n      transform: var(--block-transform);\n      transform-origin: var(--origin-x) var(--origin-y);\n    }\n  </style><style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
