  {
   "title": "Halloween at The Lafayette Bar",
   "fullUrl": "/event-calendar/halloween-at-the-lafayette-bar",
   "startDate": 1793494800844,
   "endDate": 1793505540844,
   "assetUrl": "https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5ec2b1c4a98dab4be3179e42/1785201475970-SJLTM3GQLG2ZJGS185KZ/2026-Halloween_IG.JPG",
   "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6a67fe7c90525c03f869847f\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d771b680-49a1-4d28-a6bb-fd5cbf18dfc8_1058/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d771b680-49a1-4d28-a6bb-fd5cbf18dfc8_1058/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"a704b93ee0168ed87cd4\" id=\"block-a704b93ee0168ed87cd4\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Halloween falls on a Saturday, and one of last year’s biggest parties returns. After an incredible response in 2025, local punk favorites Rubix Pube are back at the Lafayette Bar for another Halloween celebration. Their explosive live performance and loyal hometown following made this collaboration an instant tradition, and we’re excited to do it again. Brad Scott keeps the party going all night with Halloween favorites, dark danceable grooves, unexpected classics, and spooky selections that keep the dance floor moving from open to close. Adding to the atmosphere are go-go dancers Julie Bells and Sky, bringing Halloween energy to the dance floor throughout the night. Costumes are encouraged, with a cash prize awarded to the night’s best look. Featuring <em> Rubix Pube (Live) </em> Brad Scott (DJ) <em> Go-Go Dancers: Julie Bells &amp; Sky </em> Costume Contest with Cash Prize The Lafayette Bar 15 N. 4th Street, Easton, PA 9:00 PM – 1:30 AM 21+ | Non-Smoking $15 Cover Whether you’re coming for the live music, the costumes, or a packed dance floor, this is the Lafayette Bar’s Halloween party you won’t want to miss.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><a href=\"https://ra.co/events/2499242\">https://ra.co/events/2499242</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-a704b93ee0168ed87cd4 {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-a704b93ee0168ed87cd4 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-a704b93ee0168ed87cd4 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-a704b93ee0168ed87cd4 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-a704b93ee0168ed87cd4 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
