   "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6a6804630d37176601f0870b\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d771b680-49a1-4d28-a6bb-fd5cbf18dfc8_1058/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d771b680-49a1-4d28-a6bb-fd5cbf18dfc8_1058/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"8a151e43928a0b763d73\" id=\"block-8a151e43928a0b763d73\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Pink Pony Club</strong> returns to Bar XIII for a night dedicated to the biggest pop anthems, guilty pleasures, and dance floor favorites. From current chart-toppers to iconic throwbacks, expect the songs you know by heart and can’t help but sing along to.</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">DJ Brad Scott keeps the energy high all night with a mix of pop classics, club remixes, Y2K favorites, and unapologetically fun dance music. The Pink Pony Go-Gos complete the experience with performances throughout the night.</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Whether you’re here to dance, sing at the top of your lungs, or simply embrace the chaos, Pink Pony Club is your excuse to let loose.</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Saturday, August 1</strong><br><strong>9:00 PM</strong><br><strong>Bar XIII – Wilmington, DE</strong><br><strong>$10 Cover</strong><br>Featuring the Pink Pony Go-Gos</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><a href=\"https://barxiii.com/e/pink-pony-club-toxic-pop-night-2/\">https://barxiii.com/e/pink-pony-club-toxic-pop-night-2/</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-8a151e43928a0b763d73 {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-8a151e43928a0b763d73 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-8a151e43928a0b763d73 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-8a151e43928a0b763d73 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-8a151e43928a0b763d73 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
